  "description": "SOFPOU crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C74 H105 Dy3 N9 O26,0.33(Dy1 N6 O18),C1 H4 O1,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 12 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.525-3.525 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.45-97.67°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H105Dy3N9O26·0.33[Dy(NO3)6]·CH3OH·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
